{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107060","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1710706001:1":{"text":"Ah... Gwendolyn, it has been too long.","source_cn":"呼……莫德琳，好久不见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56658F9358483D20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710706002:1":{"text":"You have a few more lines around your eyes than when I last saw you.","source_cn":"你好像……比我上次见你的时候，又多了几道细纹呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD07874E4BABC9CD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710706003:1":{"text":"It has been three years.","source_cn":"老师，距离您上次见我，已经过去三年了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD517C8B235452860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710706004:1":{"text":"So long? How time slips away...","source_cn":"……这样啊，时间过得真快啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35D7357E567307FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710706005:1":{"text":"You woke me so urgently. Is it <style=\"highlight\">Maximilian</style>? Has his condition worsened again?","source_cn":"这么急着叫醒我，是<style=highlight>马...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86F2F4A8DF6AB7DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710706006:1":{"text":"His status is the same, thank you for asking. But this is another, more pressing matter.","source_cn":"……他确实不太好，多谢您挂念。但这次召唤您，是有更棘手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF119B403C5C477EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::0":{"text":"Feather","source_cn":"羽毛","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AD944E6AE000682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710706007:1":{"text":"We have a feather, taken from a Mauler. I share no bond with him, so my divination won't work.","source_cn":"这里有一根蛮血的羽毛，我与他并无连接，所以无法使用意象预示。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29245ED5764B058F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710706008:1":{"text":"I hope you can use it as a beacon. Enter his deepest dream and <style=\"highlight\">manifest</style> for us what you find there.","source_cn":"我希望您能以此为信标，进入他的深层梦境，并将您看到的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF41A9E358F9026E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710706009:1":{"text":"We need to know the secret he's protecting...","source_cn":"我们需要知道他守护的秘密……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53C0E8F2F278EF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710706010:1":{"text":"Hmm... The connection is faint, but the emotions on this feather... They're strong.","source_cn":"唔……虽然连接很微弱，但这上面残留着很强烈的情绪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C984980BD2CEDEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710706011:1":{"text":"That's more than enough. If he dreams, I can peer inside.","source_cn":"对于我来说，这就是最好的信标。只要他还会做梦，我就能窥视。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x541FFC0B02266B23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1710706011":{"text":"That's more than enough. If he dreams, I can peer inside.","source_cn":"对于我来说，这就是最好的信标。只要他还会做梦，我就能窥视。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x541FFC0B02266B23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710706012:1":{"text":"Oh? Merlin, you're here too?","source_cn":"咦？梅林，怎么是你……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC0D1A4B86AE1D18D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh? Merlin, you're here too?","female":"Oh? Merlin, you're here too?","variant_male_record_index":"224754","variant_female_record_index":"224755","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710706013:1":{"text":"So you left Avalon to find Gwendolyn?","source_cn":"所以你从阿瓦隆离开，是来了莫德琳这里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x955DAF0DE563A50D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So you left Avalon to find Gwendolyn?","female":"So you left Avalon to find Gwendolyn?","variant_male_record_index":"224756","variant_female_record_index":"224757","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1710706013":{"text":"So you left Avalon to find Gwendolyn?","source_cn":"所以你从阿瓦隆离开，是来了莫德琳这里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x955DAF0DE563A50D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So you left Avalon to find Gwendolyn?","female":"So you left Avalon to find Gwendolyn?","variant_male_record_index":"224756","variant_female_record_index":"224757","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710706014:1":{"text":"That sounds lively.","source_cn":"庆典吗？听起来很热闹呢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x752BAF34C51BD002","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That sounds lively.","female":"That sounds lively.","variant_male_record_index":"224758","variant_female_record_index":"224759","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710706015:1":{"text":"Are you interested? Care to join us for next year's Ascension Festival?","source_cn":"老师也感兴趣吗？那我明年也邀请你来参加升华庆典。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6860B95F2253BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710706016:1":{"text":"It commemorates the first king, Rolan the Great.","source_cn":"这是为了纪念初代国王——罗兰大帝，而特别设置的节日。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE291C88B73B038","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710706017:1":{"text":"Mm... Rolan? But isn't he—","source_cn":"唔……纪念罗兰？他不是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD73A59B7BF4924EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710706018:1":{"text":"Let's save the history lesson, shall we? I'm on tenterhooks to see what's in that guy's head!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，不要寒暄了，让我们看看蛮血的梦里到底有什么吧，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B4CB8D90BC90E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710706019:1":{"text":"Very well. Give me the feather.","source_cn":"嗯……那就把蛮血的羽毛交给我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD569E72D7F9A11F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"She invited me to a festival.","source_cn":"莫德琳邀请我来参加庆典","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2319C99F6832CD9B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"She invited me to a festival.","female":"She invited me to a festival.","variant_male_record_index":"88341","variant_female_record_index":"88342","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"